Third-party source material
----------------------------------------------------------------------

The map tiles in this repository (the .svg.gz files under
tile-generation/toronto-svg-tiles/ and the tile indexes) are rendered
from OpenStreetMap data. The web-app client also fetches OpenStreetMap
data live via the Overpass API.

